---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../consts";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms — Parenza"
  description="Parenza's terms of service are being finalized ahead of general availability. Design partners are onboarded under a written agreement."
  path="/terms"
  heading="Terms"
  subhead="In progress — Parenza is pre-launch, with no public signup and no billing."
>
  <section>
    <p>
      There is no self-serve signup and no paid plan yet, so there is no
      subscription contract to present. Terms of service will be published before
      Parenza opens to the public.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Design partners are onboarded under a written agreement covering data
      handling, confidentiality, and what each side commits to during the pilot.
      You'll see it before you share anything about your family.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      One thing that will not change between now and then: Parenza is not a
      medical device and does not provide medical, clinical, or regulated
      financial advice. It summarizes established guidance and helps you prepare
      decisions. It does not replace your GP, midwife, health visitor, or a
      qualified adviser, and it is not for emergencies.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Questions:{" "}
      <a
        href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}
        class="text-pz-clay-strong underline underline-offset-2">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a
      >.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
